-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Not checkable, and why
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
--   20261001000600
--
-- 20261001000600 rewrites dispatch.ring_radii_miles from [15,30,60] to [10,30,60] and the owner
-- later chose the 15-mile first wave deliberately, so the current value is [15,30,60] and no query
-- can tell "never applied" from "applied and reversed". It is recorded, which is the safe side:
-- its body acts only when the value is exactly [15,30,60], so a replay would narrow wave 1 again.
